{"id":"x37ysx4jmioltchb67zdemf1v","title":"肠道菌群与糖尿病：第二大脑的奥秘","originalTitle":"[转载]血糖命运的幕后推手：肠道菌群这颗“第二大脑”有多关键？（上）","summary":"过去二十年，糖尿病的理解从单一的胰岛素缺乏转向复杂的代谢失衡，肠道菌群成为关键因素。全球糖尿病患者已达5.89亿，中国患者占全球四分之一。研究发现，肠道菌群失调与胰岛素抵抗密切相关，通过调整饮食、益生菌和AI模型干预，有望实现早期预警和管理。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=2040048&do=blog&id=1560862"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T02:59:58.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T08:04:54.686Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T08:04:54.686Z","category":"clinical","tags":["研究成果"],"score":44,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}